      "input": {
        "document": {
          "text": "Aster X100 was tested with cotton shirts on the standard cycle. The washing cycle took 114 minutes, while the spin speed was set to 1200 rpm. The detergent drawer was checked separately. The lab retained the same water supply.\n\nThis model then ran a synthetic-fabric cycle at another temperature. The remaining moisture was recorded, but the report did not claim that the temperature alone caused the change. The operator cleaned the filter before the next session.\n\nA later test repeated the first programme. The results were recorded but have not been compared to another product.",
          "sha256": "81d8982891b6976ed3c3123407f890354dfa7e2f0df4fdd5fcf763c01211c529",
          "source": {
