          "text": "This player sounded balanced on the first recording. The reviewer kept the amplifier and speakers unchanged and did not measure the frequency response directly. The disc transport was inspected separately from the sound test. TEAC VRDS-701 includes a DAC and analogue outputs.\n\nA listening session used the same recordings but a different pair of headphones. The reviewer described a change in presentation and explicitly called this a subjective judgement.\n\nNo measurement of the transport mechanism was published.",
