        "document": {
          "text": "Lumen C30 advertises a fast brewing time according to the packaging. The manufacturer also describes a detachable milk tank and a warming plate. Neither statement is presented as an independent laboratory measurement.\n\nThis model measured a longer extraction time under the review setup. The water temperature was changed, and the filter basket was cleaned between shots. The reviewer did not publish identical settings for the advertised number.\n\nThese reports must remain distinct until the protocols can be checked.",
          "sha256": "99c928a8c4947cf35fecdb81ad9f363c838d49903590495ab49583e26b299242",
