          "text": "Raven A120 was used for a batch of potato wedges. The removable basket has a perforated insert and a temperature sensor near the back of its cavity. The sensor was not independently calibrated during this trial.\n\nIt ran hotter than expected after twelve minutes. The editor did not clarify whether the sentence described the basket sensor, the cooking compartment or the temperature setting. The model was unplugged before the final inspection.\n\nA further cooking trial used a different portion size.",
